```

### Responsibility Assignment Matrix (Tabular View)

| Component | Primary Responsibilities | Key Collaborators |
|-----------|-------------------------|-------------------|
| **CLI** | Initialize components, run event loop, handle input/commands, manage permissions, display output | AgentLoop, CompletionResolver, ToolRegistry, PermissionGate, SkillLoader, AgentLoader, SystemPrompt, Config, Provider, Logger |
| **AgentLoop** | Execute reasoning loop, manage state, call provider, execute tools, handle limits, prevent loops | Provider, ToolRegistry, PermissionGate, Types, AgentState, Logger |
| **AgentState** | Hold messages, track steps, track tool calls, track output limits | Types (Message, Block) |
| **CompletionResolver** | Run review loop, build review input, parse review, manage retries, inject feedback | Provider, AgentLoop, Types, Logger |
| **Provider (interface)** | Abstract completion interface | - |
| **OpenAICompatibleProvider** | HTTP API communication, payload building, response parsing, error handling | Types, httpx |
| **Types** | Core data structures: Message, Block, ToolCall, ToolResult, ToolSchema, ModelResponse, Tool interface | - |
| **ToolRegistry** | Register/retrieve tools, provide schemas, execute tools | Tool, ToolSchema |
| **ReadFileTool** | Read files with offset/limit, validate paths, truncate, format with line numbers | PathValidation, Truncation |
| **WriteFileTool** | Write files, create directories, validate paths | PathValidation |
| **EditFileTool** | Replace exact string, validate uniqueness, show context on failure | PathValidation |
| **GlobTool** | Find files by pattern, return sorted relative paths, truncate | Truncation |
| **GrepTool** | Regex search in files, return file:line matches, support include filter, validate paths, truncate | PathValidation, Truncation |
| **BashTool** | Execute shell commands, check deny list, validate workdir, capture output with timeout, truncate | PathValidation, Truncation, DenyList |
| **AskUserTool** | Delegate user interaction to callback, support fixed choices | CLI callback |
| **PlanTool** | Delegate plan approval to callback, validate structure | CLI callback |
| **PermissionGate** | Check permissions (always/auto/prompt), check bash deny list, manage allow/deny lists | DenyList |
| **PathValidation** | Resolve & validate paths within project root, prevent traversal | - |
| **DenyList** | Define dangerous patterns, check commands | - |
| **Truncation** | Truncate output to max size, add notice | - |
| **Config** | Load from env files, provide defaults, validate | python-dotenv |
| **Skill** | Load SKILL.md with frontmatter, format for prompt | PyYAML |
| **SkillLoader** | Discover skills, load & cache, format for prompt | Skill, PyYAML |
| **Agent** | Load agent .md with frontmatter, format for prompt | PyYAML |
| **AgentLoader** | Discover agents, load agents.md default, cache & retrieve, format for prompt | Agent, PyYAML |
| **SystemPrompt** | Build system prompt template, inject tools/skills/agents, load AGENT.md, build normalizer prompt | Config, ToolRegistry, SkillLoader, AgentLoader |
| **Logger** | Setup rotating file + console logging, provide typed log functions | logging, RotatingFileHandler |